 MAVEN :                      Build automation        &        Project Management 
                                  |                                     |
            It helps Complie & Package JAVA Project                It helps in dependencies Management 

why Maven ?

   Usually used for the JAVA projects, we need upto date version of External dependencies 

HEART OF MAVEN :  pom file

  Maven will automatically download the new dependies, paths, everything will be take care by maven itself , known as Project Management tool

  Maven is used to 
                    RUN test
                     Create JAR / WAR file
                     Using plugin can check security vunerability

Download URL :  maven.apache2.org
               bin-> mvn [ env -> env -> system variable -> new MAVEN HOME -> path paste
                         path -> new -> paste path
  check
    CMD: mvn --version
---------------------------------------
              structure:
---------------------------------------
   
   application
   |
   |-pom                 # project object Model
   |-SRC
       |-main 
       |      |-JAVA           # JAVA Source Code
       |      |-resource       # Config file
       |      |-webapps        # webapps
       |
       |-test
            |-JAVA             # Unit Test'S
            |-resource
            |-NIT
            
-------------------------------------------------      

  Local Repo:    Stored on your computer
Central Repo:  default Global repo
 remote Repo:   own created repo for organaization [ prvt repo ]











     
